{"code":"367000","name":"플래티어","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"IT서비스","sector_desc":"시스템 구축(SI)·운영·클라우드 서비스. 기업 IT 투자 규모와 그룹사 물량에 실적이 연동됩니다.","desc":"동사는 2005년 설립된 버티컬 AI/DX 솔루션 제공 엔터프라이즈 B2B 전문기업으로, 2021년 코스닥시장 상장함. 이커머스·마케팅 등에서 20년간 기업 업무와 시스템을 설계·운영하며, Enterprise AX, AI CX, Intelligent DX 등 4대 사업을 전개하고 있음. 동사는 'AX Foundry' 기반 P.A.V.E 전략으로 비즈니스 가치를 창출하며, 금융, 공공, 방산 등 다양한 산업으로 확장하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-30","n_days":300,"close":3350.0,"open":3345.0,"high":3465.0,"low":3110.0,"volume":1905,"amount":6381750.0,"ret_1d":0.0,"gap":-0.1493,"range_pct":10.597,"ret_5":2.9186,"ret_20":-3.4582,"ret_60":14.1397,"ret_120":-17.6904,"ret_250":-21.1765,"ma20":3388.0,"ma60":3374.6667,"ma120":3272.375,"ma200":3539.175,"close_vs_ma200":-5.3452,"close_vs_ma60":-0.7309,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":30.4119,"r2_60":0.1486,"slope_120":7.153,"r2_120":0.0092,"slope_250":-31.9321,"r2_250":0.5959,"high52":5200.0,"low52":2445.0,"pos_52w":32.8494,"dd_52w":-35.5769,"mdd_1y":-47.8,"atr14_pct":10.064,"vol_ann_60":38.9292,"vol_avg20":3141.8,"vol_ratio20":0.6063,"vr5":0.5592,"vr20":0.3733,"amount_avg5":8378630.0,"amount_avg20":10761574.0,"amount_avg60":14600069.6667,"obv_chg20":6.657,"turnover_20":0.7491,"pv_eff_20":-4.6165,"rsi14":49.0301,"frgn_net_5":413.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0049,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0049,"frgn_net_20":-1249.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.0149,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":-0.0149,"frgn_net_60":-662.0,"inst_net_60":0.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.0079,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0,"smart_net_60_pct":-0.0079,"frgn_net_120":9492.0,"inst_net_120":0.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.1132,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0,"smart_net_120_pct":0.1132,"foreign_ratio":0.87,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.09,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":4.0,"op_margin_q":3.8462,"op_qoq":128.5714,"op_turnaround":1.0,"op_yoy":122.2222,"rev_yoy":6.1224,"op_trend_4q":35.7895,"fin_period":"202606","roe":-5.91,"debt_ratio":84.78,"per":null,"pbr":0.86,"div_yield":null,"fo